// A fifo at the plate path is not the plate.
// The read ignores it and does not open it.
// The write replaces that fifo and does not open it.
// A waiting writer is not paired.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE platefifo ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law      ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG platefifo law

IMPULSE platefifo 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "platefifo" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
